  storyText: "A door shut behind me?!  How is that possible? \nIt's okay, there's
    no need to panic... \nI've heard rumors about a way to escape.\n\nThere is a
    Key deep within the maze ahead. The one that grants my exit from this level.
    It's a cursed path, but the only one that will put me one step closer to escaping
    this nightmare.\n\nThis place is waiting to claim me. If I hesitate, if I get
    lost, or if I let them catch me... it's over. Stay sharp. Stay alive. Find the
    key."
  bookUI: {fileID: 32087112}
  interactDistance: 2
