MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1444604984}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7bea55e231277cd418a21ff37e351443, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  bookSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d2e582a834e1a842816077df2d42b1c, type: 3}
  storyText: 'There it is... The Temple of the Forgotten Kingdom. They say it holds
    treasures beyond measure... But it''s not just ancient its creepy... The type
    that makes your skin crawl.


    The air in there is thick, heavy. Almost like
    its poisionous. Something is moving inside those stone walls, something that
    doesn''t belong to this world. I''ve heard the stories: the darkness, the things
    that are within it... I can''t imagine what kind of monsters this place has.


    I
    have the flashlight, but the darkness swallows the light. I need to keep my eyes
    peeled for anything that can help. I''ve seen faint glowing objects nearby...
    Batteries for the light, so I''m not stumbling blind... and maybe, just maybe,
    I can find some Hearts to keep me going.'
  bookUI: {fileID: 32087112}
  interactDistance: 2
